$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Alvatar" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other in this fast paced game of Flag Ball! What is flag ball? Each team is set in a small arena where they must capture the enemy flag and carry it about 100 yards to their own flag to score. During this time, the other team will try to slaughter, kill, and destroy you! Football now has a new meaning, in the future we play Flag ball, welcome to the Flag_Arena2!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map By:<f4> Lisa W.  (XGN LadyShar) Pick up all the Xtreme Gaming map packs at www.xtremegaming.net" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Final Word:<f4> Map idea taken from XGN Optimizers original Flag_Arena and I say Thanks to him for the permission he has given me to create Flag_Arena2, THANKS :-)";
